      "name": "Suppressing Blast",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "Mark a Stress and target a group within Far range. All targets must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll or take 1d8+2 magic damage. You gain a Fear for each target who marked HP from this attack."
